{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) 2x + y = 8 এবং 3x - 2y = 5 হলে (x, y) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) (3, 2)", "option2": "খ) (2, 3)", "option3": "গ) (1, 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (3, 3)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>2x + y = 8 ...........(1)<br />3x - 2y = 5 ...........(2)<br />(1) নং থেকে পাই, y = 8 - 2x ...........(3)<br />(2) এ (3) এর y এর বসিয়ে পাই,<br />3x - 2(8 - 2x) = 5<br />&rArr; 3x - 16 + 4x = 5<br />&rArr; 7x = 21<br />&rArr; x = 3<br />(3) নং থেকে পাই, y = 8 - 6 = 2<br />&there4; (x, y) = (3, 2)</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) log<sub>y</sub>(&sup3;&radic;3) = 1/15 হলে y এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 9", "option2": "খ) 27", "option3": "গ) 81", "option4": "ঘ) 243", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>log<sub>y</sub>(&sup3;&radic;3) = 1/15<br />&rArr; y<sup>(1/15)</sup> = (&sup3;&radic;3)<br />&rArr; y<sup>(1/15)</sup> = 3<sup>(5/15)</sup><br />&rArr; y<sup>(1/15)</sup> = (3<sup>5</sup>)<sup>1/15</sup><br />&rArr; y = 3<sup>5</sup> = 243</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) 4<sup>(x + 1)</sup> = 64 হলে, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 3", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 3/2", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>4<sup>(x + 1)</sup> = 64<br />&rArr; 2<sup>(2x + 2)</sup> = 2<sup>6</sup><br />&rArr; 2x + 2 = 6<br />&rArr; 2x = 4<br />&rArr; x = 2</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) দুই অঙ্কবিশিষ্ট কোনো সংখ্যার অঙ্কদ্বয়ের সমষ্টির সাথে 10 যোগ করলে যোগফল হবে সংখ্যাটির দশক স্থানীয় অঙ্কের ছয় গুণ। আর সংখ্যাটির অঙ্ক দ্বয় স্থান বিনিময় করলে যে সংখ্যা পাওয়া যাবে, তা মূল সংখ্যাটি থেকে 9 কম হবে। সংখ্যাটি কত?", "option1": "ক) 4/95", "option2": "খ) 85/3", "option3": "গ) 90/4", "option4": "ঘ) 95/4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>মনে করি, নির্ণেয় সংখ্যার দশম স্থানীয় অঙ্ক x এবং একক স্থানীয় অঙ্ক y। অতএব, সংখ্যাটি 10x + y।<br />১ম শর্ত, x + y + 10 = 6x ........(1)<br />&there4; y = 5x - 10 ...........(2)<br /> ২য় শর্ত, 10y + x = 10x + y - 9<br />&rArr; 10y + x - 10x - y + 9 = 0<br />&rArr; 9(5x - 10) - 9x + 9 = 0<br />&rArr; 45x -90 - 9x + 9 = 0<br />&rArr; 36x = 81<br />&rArr; x = 81/36 = 9/4<br />(2) নং থেকে y = 5/4<br />&there4; নির্ণেয় সংখ্যাটি = (10 &times; 9/4) + 5/4 = 95/4</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> এর মান নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) 6<sup>(x + 1)</sup>", "option2": "খ) 6<sup>(x + 2)</sup>", "option3": "গ) 3<sup>(2x + 2)</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) 6<sup>x</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup> + 6<sup>x</sup><br />= 6<sup>x</sup> (1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 1)<br />= 6<sup>x</sup> &times; 6<br />= 6<sup>(x + 1)</sup></p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) কোন শর্তে log<sub>a</sub>1 = 0 হবে?", "option1": "ক) a>0", "option2": "খ) a = 1", "option3": "গ) a &ne; 0, a&gt;2", "option4": "ঘ) a&gt;0, a&ne;1", "answer": "4", "exp": "log<sub>a</sub>1 = 0 হবে যখন a&gt;0, a&ne;1"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) গীতা, রিতা, মিতার একত্রে 180 টাকা আছে। রিতার চেয়ে গীতার 6 টাকা কম ও মিতার 12 টাকা বেশি আছে। গীতার কত টাকা আছে?", "option1": "ক) 48 টাকা", "option2": "খ) 52 টাকা", "option3": "গ) 60 টাকা", "option4": "ঘ) 58 টাকা", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>মনে করি, রিতার আছে x টাকা<br />গীতার আছে (x - 6) টাকা<br />মিতার অছে (x + 12) টাকা<br />প্রশ্নমতে, x + x - 6 + x + 12 = 180<br />বা, 3x = 180 - 6<br />বা, x = 174/3<br />বা, x= 58<br />&there4; গীতার আছে (58 - 6) = 52 টাকা।</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 5<sup>(3x-7)</sup> = 3<sup>(3x - 7)</sup> রাশিটির সমাধান কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 2/4", "option2": "খ) 4/9", "option3": "গ) 7/3", "option4": "ঘ) 0", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>5<sup>(3x-7)</sup> = 3<sup>(3x - 7)</sup> <br />&rArr; 5<sup>(3x-7)</sup>/3<sup>(3x-7)</sup> = 1<br />&rArr; (5/3)<sup>(3x - 7)</sup> = (5/3)<sup>0</sup><br />&rArr; 3x - 7 = 0<br />&rArr; x = 7/3</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) মাতার বর্তমান বয়স তার দুই কন্যার বয়সের সমষ্টির চারগুণ। 5 বছর পর মাতার বয়স ঐ দুই কন্যার বয়সের সমষ্টির দ্বিগুণ হবে।মাতার বর্তমান বয়স কত?", "option1": "ক) 40 বছর", "option2": "খ) 50 বছর", "option3": "গ) 30 বছর", "option4": "ঘ) 35 বছর", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>মনে করি, দুই কন্যার বর্তমান বয়সের সমষ্টি x বছর<br />&there4; মাতার বর্তমান বয়স = 4x বছর<br />5 বছর পরে মাতার বয়স হবে (4x +5) বছর<br />5 বছর পরে দুই কন্যার বয়সের সমষ্টি হবে (x + 10) বছর<br />প্রশ্নমতে,<br />(4x + 5) = 2(x + 10)<br />বা,4x - 2x = 15<br />বা,2x = 15<br />বা,x = 7.5<br />&there4; মাতার বর্তমান বয়স =(4 &times; 7.5) = 30 বছর</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) (2a<sup>-1</sup> + 3b<sup>-1</sup>)<sup>-1</sup> রাশির সরলতম রূপ কি হবে?", "option1": "ক) ab/(3a + 2b)", "option2": "খ) 3a + 2b", "option3": "গ) 1/(3a + 2b)", "option4": "ঘ) 1", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(2a<sup>-1</sup> + 3b<sup>-1</sup>)<sup>-1</sup> <br />= (2 (1/a) + 3(1/b))<sup>-1</sup><br />= ((3a + 2b)/ab)<sup>-1</sup><br />= ab/(3a + 2b)</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) log<sub>(&radic;8)</sub> x = 10/3 হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 46", "option2": "খ) 64", "option3": "গ) 32", "option4": "ঘ) 23", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log<sub>(&radic;8)</sub> x = 10/3<br />&rArr; (&radic;8)<sup>10/3</sup> = x<br />&rArr; (2<sup>3/2</sup>)<sup>10/3</sup> = x<br />&rArr; 2<sup>5</sup> = x<br />&rArr; x = 32</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) 3x - 2y = 2; 5x - 3y = 5 হলে (x, y) এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) (5, 4)", "option2": "খ) (4, 5)", "option3": "গ) (4/3, 5)", "option4": "ঘ) (1, 4)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>3x - 2y = 2 ........(1)<br />&there4; x = (2 + 2y)/3 .....(3)<br />5x - 3y = 5 .........(2)<br />বা,(5(2 + 2y))/3 - 3y = 5 [(3) এর x মান বসিয়ে]<br />বা,10 + 10y - 9y = 15<br />বা,y = 15 - 10<br />বা,y = 5<br />y এর মান (3) নং এ বসিয়ে পাই,<br />x = (2 + 10)/3 = 12/3 = 4<br />&there4; (x, y) = (4, 5)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) (a/b)<sup>(x - 5)</sup> = (b/a)<sup>(x - 7)</sup> হলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 6", "option4": "ঘ) 9", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>(a/b)<sup>(x - 5)</sup> = (b/a)<sup>(x - 7)</sup> <br />&rArr; (a/b)<sup>(x - 5)</sup> = (a/b)<sup>(7 - x)</sup><br />&rArr; x - 5 = 7 - x<br />&rArr; 2x = 12<br />&rArr; x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) যদি দুটি সংখ্যার যোগফল এবং গুণফল যথাক্রমে 40 এবং 120 হয়, তবে সংখ্যা দুটির ব্যস্তানুপাতিক যোগফল কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) 1/4", "option2": "খ) 1/3", "option3": "গ) 1/2", "option4": "ঘ) 5/24", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>ধরি, সংখ্যা দুটি a, b<br />&there4; সংখ্যা দুটির ব্যস্তানুপাতি হবে যথাক্রমে 1/a, 1/b<br />এখানে, a + b = 40; ab = 120 <br />&there4; 1/a + 1/b = (a + b)/ab = 40/120 = 1/3</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) log<sub>2</sub>8 = কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>log<sub>2</sub>8 <br />= log<sub>2</sub>2&sup3;<br />= 3.log<sub>2</sub>2 [ log<sub>a</sub>a = 1]<br />= 3.1<br />= 3</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) কোনো ভগ্নাংশের লবের সাথে 3 যোগ করলে ভগ্নাংশটির মান 2 হয় এবং হরের সাথে 3 বাদ দিলে ভগ্নাংশটির মান 3 হয়। ভাগ্নাংশটি কত?", "option1": "ক) 1/6", "option2": "খ) 3/5", "option3": "গ) 7/9", "option4": "ঘ) 9/6", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>ধরি, ভগ্নাংশটি = x/y<br />প্রশ্নমতে, (x + 3)/y = 2 ..........(1) এবং x/(y - 3) = 3 ...........(2)<br />(1) নং থেকে পাই, x =2y - 3 .......(3)<br />(3) এর x এর মান (2) এ বসিয়ে <br />2y - 3 = 3y - 9<br />&rArr; -y = - 6<br />&rArr; y = 6<br />y এর মান (3) এ বসিয়ে পাই, x = 9<br />&there4; নির্ণেয় ভগ্নাংশ = 9/6 </p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) a + b =2, ab = 1 হলে a এবং b এর মান যথাক্রমে কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) (0, 2)", "option2": "খ) (1, 1)", "option3": "গ) (-1, 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (-3, 4)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a + b = 2 .......(1)<br />ab = 1 ......(2)<br />&there4; b = 1/a .......(3)<br />b এর মান (1) এ বসিয়ে পাই,<br />a + (1/a) = 2<br />&rArr; a&sup2; + 1 = 2a<br />&rArr; a&sup2; - 2a + 1 = 0<br />&rArr; (a - 1)&sup2; = 0<br />&rArr; a = 1<br />a এর মান (3) এ বসিয়ে পাই,<br />b = 1<br />&there4; (a, b) = (1, 1)</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) x<sup>0</sup> + y<sup>0</sup> + z<sup>1</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2 + z", "option3": "গ) 3", "option4": "ঘ) z", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x<sup>0</sup> + y<sup>0</sup> + z<sup>1</sup> <br />= 1 + 1 + z<br />= 2 + z</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1940-19.png'/>", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) a", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(a<sup>p+q</sup> &divide; a<sup>2r</sup>) &times; (a<sup>q+r</sup> &divide; a<sup>2p</sup>) &times; (a<sup>r+p</sup> &divide; a<sup>2q</sup>)<br />= a<sup>(p+q - 2r)</sup> &times; a<sup>(q+r - 2p)</sup> &times; a<sup>(r+p - 2q)</sup><br />= a<sup>0</sup><br />= 1</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) ((&sup3;&radic;2) &times; (&sup3;&radic;3))<sup>6</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 144", "option2": "খ) 360", "option3": "গ) 44", "option4": "ঘ) 36", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>((&sup3;&radic;2) &times; (&sup3;&radic;3))<sup>6</sup> <br />= (2)<sup>6/3</sup> &times; (3)<sup>6/3</sup><br />= (2)&sup2; &times; (3)&sup2;<br />= 4 &times; 9<br />= 36</p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) 3log<sub>10</sub>2 + 2log<sub>10</sub>3 + log<sub>10</sub>5 এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) log<sub>10</sub>360", "option2": "খ) log<sub>2</sub>360", "option3": "গ) log<sub>10</sub>36", "option4": "ঘ) log<sub>10</sub>60", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>3log<sub>10</sub>2 + 2log<sub>10</sub>3 + log<sub>10</sub>5<br />= log<sub>10</sub>2&sup3; + log<sub>10</sub>3&sup2; + log<sub>10</sub>5<br />= log<sub>10</sub>(2&sup3; &times; 3&sup2; &times; 5)<br />= log<sub>10</sub>360</p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1940-22.png'/>", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) xyz", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>&radic;(x<sup>-1</sup>y) &times; &radic;(y<sup>-1</sup>z) &times; &radic;(z<sup>-1</sup>x)<br />= &radic;(y/x) &times; &radic;(z/y) &times; &radic;(x/z)<br />= &radic;1 = 1</p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) 400 এর লগ 4 হলে ভিত্তি কত?", "option1": "ক) 2&radic;5", "option2": "খ) 3&radic;5", "option3": "গ) &radic;5", "option4": "ঘ) &radic;4", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>ধরি, ভিত্তি a <br />প্রশ্নমতে, log<sub>a</sub>400 = 4<br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> = 400<br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> = (20)&sup2;<br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> = (4 &times; 5)&sup2;<br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> = 2<sup>4</sup> (&radic;5)<sup>4</sup><br />বা, a<sup>4</sup> = (2&radic;5)<sup>4</sup><br />&there4; a = 2&radic;5<br />&there4; ভিত্তি a = 2&radic;5</p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1940-24Q.png'/>", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) abc", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1940-24E.png'/><br />log<sub>e</sub>((a&sup3;b&sup3;/c&sup3;) &times; (b&sup3;c&sup3;/d&sup3;) &times; (c&sup3;d&sup3;/a&sup3;)) - log<sub>e</sub> (b&sup2;c)&sup3;<br />= log<sub>e</sub>b<sup>6</sup>c&sup3; - log<sub>e</sub>b<sup>6</sup>c&sup3;<br />= 0</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) (100)<sup>0</sup>x = কত?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) x", "option3": "গ) 100x", "option4": "ঘ) 100", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>(100)<sup>0</sup>x <br />= 1 &times; x<br />= x</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1500000, "pk": 1940, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 1940}